      "updated_at": "2020-02-26T11:28:48Z",
      "body": "And the inverse would be true: I reply to something in the livechat window and it is not sent to followers because it was a note and I will not understand why.\r\n\r\nEither we have buttons to choose between discussion and note, either I would not change anything. The \"last message sent\" heuristic is tricky for me. It makes sense for emails because you reply to a specific message; in the livechat you post on the global discussion thread.",
